## Support

If you encounter issues:
1. Check Android Studio's Logcat for error messages
2. Verify all files match the provided code exactly
3. Ensure devices meet minimum requirements
4. Try rebuilding project: Build → Clean Project → Rebuild Project

Good luck building your YouTube Ad Skip Remote! This is a great project that showcases Wear OS development, Android accessibility services, and device-to-device communication.
